WEBVTT

00:00:09,550 --> 00:00:18,500
Is ghee safe to eat? Yes, generally. Yes. Now remember, even if I have you on a dairy-free diet,

00:00:19,940 --> 00:00:24,260
this is the question that we often get. What about butter? Well, butter is dairy, obviously,

00:00:24,260 --> 00:00:30,020
but if you're just using butter very lightly and you're not using a lot of it on a daily basis,

00:00:30,020 --> 00:00:36,020
butter is far better for you than any of the plant-based, larger type things. So you've got to kind of weigh

00:00:36,020 --> 00:00:38,020
that out.

